#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/alibaba/alibaba.rst:62
msgid "Following Integration"
msgstr "Following Integration"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/alibaba/alibaba.rst:64
msgid ""
"After the integration has been created, |morpheus| will sync existing "
"workloads (if you've opted to inventory), security groups, tags, and more. "
"Synced workloads can be viewed from |InfCom|. If Plans aren't immediately "
"available within a few minutes after the integration is created, navigate to"
" the Cloud detail page (|InfClo| > Your Integrated Alibaba Cloud), click "
":guilabel:`REFRESH` and click \"Daily\". Shortly thereafter, the Plans "
"should be synced and selectable at provision time. Without manually syncing "
"the Plans, you may be unable to provision to this Cloud until it undertakes "
"its next daily sync overnight as Plan selection is required."
msgstr ""
"After la integración tiene sido creado, |morpheus| será sync existente "
"workloads (if you've opted to inventory), security groups, tags, y más. "
"Synced workloads se puede ver desde |InfCom|. If Plans aren't immediately "
"disponible dentro de un few minutes después de la integración es creado, "
"navigate to el Cloud página de detalles (|InfClo| > Your Integrated Alibaba "
"Cloud), click :guilabel:`REFRESH` y click \"Daily\". Shortly thereafter, el "
"Plans debería be synced y selectable at provision time. Without manualmente "
"syncing el Plans, you puede be unable to provision to este Cloud hasta it "
"undertakes its siguiente daily sync overnight as Plan selection es "
"requerido."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/alibaba/alibaba.rst:66
msgid ""
"You're now able to provision new Instances and Apps to the Alibaba Cloud. "
"|morpheus| includes a default catalog that includes Alibaba images which can"
" be provisioned out of the box. Additionally, you can begin to create your "
"own custom library of Alibaba workloads by adding Virtual Images and "
"building out Instance Types."
msgstr ""
"You're ahora able to provision nuevo Instances y Apps to el Alibaba Cloud. "
"|morpheus| includes un predeterminado catalog que includes Alibaba images "
"cual puede be provisioned out of el box. Adicionalmente, you puede begin to "
"create your own personalizado library of Alibaba workloads by adding Virtual"
" Images y building out Instance Types."
